


Shiri sarrafa-ƙwaƙwalwa: 0.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['Empty']. }.
>> p := Gaskiya.
>> a := Jeri ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Shiri tsaftace.
usedMemory1 := (Shiri ƙwaƙwalwa ? 0).




x := 1.
y := ['Hello'].
q := { ['Empty']. }.
p := Gaskiya.
a := Jeri ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 5.

Shiri tsaftace.
usedMemory2 := (Shiri ƙwaƙwalwa ? 0).




